<div class="bg-cream border-b border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-14">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-brand mb-3">About</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black font-display text-ink leading-tight">How matching works</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
  <div class="space-y-6 text-ink leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      Recipe Finder helps you discover what you can cook with the ingredients you already have.
    </p>
    <p>
      When you enter your ingredients, the app ranks recipes by how many ingredients you're
      missing. Recipes requiring the fewest additional items appear first.
    </p>
    <p>
      Pantry staples (salt, pepper, oil, butter, sugar, flour) are assumed to always be available
      and don't count against your match score.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-12">
    <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5">
      <p class="text-3xl font-black font-display text-brand mb-1">1</p>
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Enter ingredients</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-smoke">Type what's in your kitchen, comma separated.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5">
      <p class="text-3xl font-black font-display text-brand mb-1">2</p>
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink mb-1">We rank recipes</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-smoke">Fewest missing ingredients first, then best match and time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5">
      <p class="text-3xl font-black font-display text-brand mb-1">3</p>
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink mb-1">Cook</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-smoke">Open a recipe for the full ingredient list and details.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold font-display text-ink mb-3">Transparency</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-smoke">
      Recipe data originates from Allrecipes. This application was built with the help of AI tools
      (Claude) for code generation and assistance.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10">
    <a href="<%= root_path %>" class="inline-block bg-brand hover:bg-brand-dark text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wide px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition-colors">
      Start cooking →
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
